                "fontSize": "28",
                "fontWeight": "400",
                "textDirection": "ltr",
                "fontVariantId": "normal-400",
                "textDecoration": "none",
                "letterSpacing": "0",
                "fills": [
                  {
                    "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "The summary line replaces \"Keep your effects, tempo and pedal setup.\" while Ed's setup is chosen. While the Ed's Rack sounds load, the line says so; when one is missing or they would not fit the effects budget, the line says why in the failure colour (card 08). In each of those cases Start new loop is disabled for Ed's setup and nothing changes. Track names are shared by every session, so a second line always says so, and it names the custom names on tracks 1 to 4 that Ed's setup replaces (card 08)."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
            "textAlign": "left",
